From: Package maintainers <packages@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] follow UAPI configuration file precedence
Source: https://cdn.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/OpenSSH/portable/openssh-9.9p1.tar.gz
Upstream: Not submitted; this is a generic UAPI configuration proposal.

Select system configuration from admin, runtime, and vendor directories.
Merge drop-ins by basename, and keep explicit command-line paths exact.
Install package defaults below /usr and keep host-owned configuration in /etc.

